@startuml

skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Purchasing Employee|
start
:Open manufacturer overview;

|System|
:Show list of manufacturers;

|Purchasing Employee|

switch (Choose action)
case (Add)
  :Enter new manufacturer data;
case (Edit)
  :Select manufacturer;
  :Edit manufacturer data;
case (Remove)
  :Select manufacturer;
  :Choose remove;
endswitch

|System|
:Validate data;

if (Data valid?) then ([yes])
  :Save changes;
  :Show confirmation;
else ([no])
  :Show error message;
endif

stop

@enduml